{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>C_syntax.Compile_driver</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"arrayjit","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Ir","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"C_syntax","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Compile_driver","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Parameters","href":"#parameters","children":[]},{"title":"Signature","href":"#signature","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Renders and compiles routines for a backend, attributing name-caused compile failures to the name.</p>","content":"<h2 id=\"parameters\"><a href=\"#parameters\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Parameters</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec parameter anchored\" id=\"argument-1-_\"><a href=\"#argument-1-_\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">module</span> </span><span><a href=\"argument-1-_/index.html\">_</a></span><span> (<a href=\"argument-1-_/argument-1-_/index.html\">_</a> : <span class=\"keyword\">sig</span> ... <span class=\"keyword\">end</span>) : <a href=\"../module-type-C_syntax_config/index.html\">C_syntax_config</a></span></code></div></div><h2 id=\"signature\"><a href=\"#signature\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Signature</h2><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-rendered\"><a href=\"#type-rendered\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span>'kparams rendered</span></span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-rendered.entries\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-rendered.entries\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>entries : <span><span>(<span class=\"type-var\">'kparams</span> * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <a href=\"../../Low_level/index.html#type-launch_dims\">Low_level.launch_dims</a>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.array</span>;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Per kernel, in batch order: its parameters, its emitted name and its launch geometry.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-rendered.assemble\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-rendered.assemble\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>assemble : <span><span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>The source of one translation unit holding the kernels at these indices, in the given order: the includes, the builtins those kernels use and their definitions, conditional includes applied. <code>assemble</code> of every index in order is the batch source <a href=\"#val-compile_batch\"><code>compile_batch</code></a> hands its compiler; <code>assemble [i]</code> is kernel <code>i</code>'s standalone source, which a kernel code cache keys on (gh-ocannl-1314).</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-rendered.assemble_units\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-rendered.assemble_units\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>assemble_units : <span><span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">max_units</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">min_unit_bytes</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span>;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>gh-ocannl-1603: the same kernels as <a href=\"#type-rendered.assemble\"><code>assemble</code></a> as several translation units, to be compiled concurrently and linked into one library: their units -- a kernel, or an outlined kernel's parts and the kernel -- packed by size into at most <code>max_units</code> sources of at least about <code>min_unit_bytes</code> each (<code>0</code>: no minimum), each with its own prelude. One unit is <code>[assemble idxs]</code> exactly.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-rendered.attribute\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-rendered.attribute\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>attribute : 'a. <span><span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.exn <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Printexc.raw_backtrace <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"type-var\">'a</span>;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Re-raises a failed compile of <code>assemble idxs</code> as <a href=\"#val-compile_batch\"><code>compile_batch</code></a> would: attributed to a routine's name when the report points at one of those kernels' declarations.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-rendered.key_text\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-rendered.key_text\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>key_text : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string;</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Kernel <code>i</code>'s standalone source as a kernel code cache keys it (gh-ocannl-1525): its prelude verbatim, its definition through <a href=\"../../Kernel_code_cache/index.html#val-canonical_kernel\"><code>Kernel_code_cache.canonical_kernel</code></a> -- the names it owns (symbols, scope locals, its nodes' identifiers, the emitter's <a href=\"../index.html#val-minted_derivations\"><code>minted_derivations</code></a> of them) renamed by first occurrence and its segment index dropped, so that an unchanged kernel keys alike whatever names the rest of the batch made it take. The backend adds the compiler options and looks the code up by the stored symbol.</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>A batch rendered but not compiled: per-kernel entries, and source assemblers over kernel indices.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-render_batch\"><a href=\"#val-render_batch\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> render_batch : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">names</span>:<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-bindings\">Indexing.bindings</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../../Low_level/index.html#type-optimized\">Low_level.optimized</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">includes</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">builtins</span>:<span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?conditional_includes</span>:<span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <a href=\"../../Backend_intf/index.html#type-kparam_source\">Backend_intf.kparam_source</a>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <a href=\"#type-rendered\">rendered</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Render a batch with one syntax instance over all of it, without compiling.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-binding_race\"><a href=\"#val-binding_race\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> binding_race : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-bindings\">Indexing.bindings</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../../Low_level/index.html#type-optimized\">Low_level.optimized</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>binding_race ~name bindings lowered</code>: the detail of the <code>hardware_binding_race</code> refusal (gh-ocannl-959) that rendering <code>lowered</code> in this dialect raises, as <a href=\"#val-compile\"><code>compile</code></a> would render it, or <code>None</code> where the render succeeds. Nothing is compiled and no text is returned. Any other refusal or exception of the render propagates, so a premise judged through this query cannot pass on an unrelated failure. The host-side seam of the GPU-gated binding-race premises (gh-ocannl-1780): a dialect that binds hardware registers, such as <a href=\"../../Cuda_like_config/index.html\"><code>Cuda_like_config</code></a>, answers the question on any host.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-drive\"><a href=\"#val-drive\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> drive : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">batch</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">names</span>:<span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-bindings\">Indexing.bindings</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../../Low_level/index.html#type-optimized\">Low_level.optimized</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.array</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">includes</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">builtins</span>:<span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?conditional_includes</span>:<span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?compiles_source</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">compile_source</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'b</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"type-var\">'b</span>\u000A  * <span><span>(<span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <a href=\"../../Backend_intf/index.html#type-kparam_source\">Backend_intf.kparam_source</a>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span>\u000A     * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string\u000A     * <a href=\"../../Low_level/index.html#type-launch_dims\">Low_level.launch_dims</a>)</span>\u000A      <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.array</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Render kernels into one source and compile it, attributing name-caused failures to the name.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compile\"><a href=\"#val-compile\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compile : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span class=\"type-var\">'a</span> <a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-bindings\">Indexing.bindings</a></span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../../Low_level/index.html#type-optimized\">Low_level.optimized</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">includes</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">builtins</span>:<span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?conditional_includes</span>:<span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"optlabel\">?compiles_source</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">compile_source</span>:<span>(<span><span class=\"label\">name</span>:<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"type-var\">'b</span>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"type-var\">'b</span>\u000A  * <span><span>(<span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.string * <a href=\"../../Backend_intf/index.html#type-kparam_source\">Backend_intf.kparam_source</a>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.list</span>\u000A  * <span class=\"xref-unresolv